flowchart LR
  PKG[Plugin Package] --> MANIFEST[Manifest: ID, Version, Capabilities, Compatibility]
  MANIFEST --> VALIDATE[Host Validation]
  VALIDATE --> PERMS{Permissions Approved?}
  PERMS -- No --> DENY[Disabled + Diagnostic]
  PERMS -- Yes --> PROC[Isolated Plugin Process]
  HOST[Plugin Host] <--> PROC
  BROKER[Permission Broker] <--> PROC
  BROKER --> FS[Scoped Filesystem]
  BROKER --> NET[Approved Network Hosts]
  BROKER --> CREDS[Named Credential Handles]
  BROKER --> RUNTIME[Approved Collector Operations]
  PROC --> SCHEMA[Schema Validation]
  SCHEMA --> EXT[Provider / Parser / Collector / Renderer / Ranker / Policy / Profile / Graph Enricher]
  EXT --> CORE[Core Contracts]
  WATCHDOG[Timeout, Cancellation, Size Limits] --> PROC
  FAIL[Crash / Violation] --> QUARANTINE[Terminate, Roll Back, Attribute Diagnostic]
  PROC -. failure .-> FAIL
